  "ingredients": [
    "4 large green tomatoes",
    "2 eggs",
    "0.5 cup milk",
    "1 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 cup cornmeal",
    "0.5 cup bread crumbs",
    "2 teaspoons coarse kosher salt",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "1 quart vegetable oil for frying"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/E0tw9MSNtcT0FhJ40wzrmTQybe4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16760-best-fried-green-tomatoes-ddmfs-step1-059-fe7523c1eb944e0d8194ebcc8d186c17.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16760/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice tomatoes 1/2-inch thick. Discard the ends.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/l_Z1VE1jrn_bL9T_V3Ohvr8QPwQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16760-best-fried-green-tomatoes-ddmfs-step2-060-c49947478ceb4f15abaa116d4ef0055e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16760/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk eggs and milk together in a medium-sized bowl. Scoop flour onto a plate. Mix cornmeal, bread crumbs, salt, and pepper on another plate. Dip tomatoes into flour to coat. Then dip tomatoes into milk and egg mixture; dredge in bread crumbs to completely coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_UK2Q0YT0jpJriMu9d1uZFIShiE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16760-best-fried-green-tomatoes-ddmfs-step4-069-23ac3f203c5946618ad41fb4777b67d2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16760/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a large deep skillet to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Place tomatoes in hot oil in batches of 4 or 5, to prevent them from touching; fry until crisp and golden brown on one side, then flip and fry on other side.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XV48_PEG5SZYWF7Gpy_10vnlbBA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16760-best-fried-green-tomatoes-ddmfs-step5-073-15b5a8b88cd44c16811f4e278bfed621.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16760/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer fried tomatoes to a paper towel-lined plate to drain. Repeat with remaining tomatoes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_jR8TZ4wACdPOhaM0Zu9xLdyWvE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16760-best-fried-green-tomatoes-ddmfs-step6-074-d7d5998f7afb43bb8ef7ee13b9849840.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16760/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
